  "description": "The emergence of Naturals created a violent stir in society—how are these superhumans with strange powers supposed to live amongst “normal” people? What are “normal” people to do if there’s a “Freak” in their midst? It is easy to fear the unknown, especially if the unknown is capable of the unimaginable. Luckily, Star Core exists to monitor these Naturals and to make sure that they put their powers to good use. And Star Core seems to be up to something. They’re putting together a new team called “Heroes” with a rogue Natural as its head. It’s the start of a new plan, one that they’re calling “Plan.B.\"\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/planb)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[English (Dropped)](https://www.lezhinx.com/detail/heroesplanb), [English](https://www.lezhinus.com/en/comic/heroesplanb), [French](https://www.delitoon.com/detail/daf_1000691)",
